\endash 20 hit points and use a }{\i\fs24 wish}{\fs24  or a 10th\_
level destroy spell at triple difficulty. The DM also might decide that some exotic process (see page 91) or special weapon can also kill the creature permanently. For example, a paragon gorgon might be killed permanentl
y if a noble genie eats its heart or if the killing blow is delivered with an ancient king\rquote s sword.
