\par }{\fs24\super 1}{\fs24  The caster\rquote s level applies to adjusted difficulty before any other modifiers for material components and conditions.
\par 
\par }{\fs24\super 2}{\fs24  Specialist wizards receive this modifier when casting true dweomers that use a type of spell from their schools of specialization.
