\par }{\i\fs24 Minor: }{\fs24 These effects impair\emdash but do not incapacitate\emdash the character, such as blindness, deafness, and ability score reductions. Spells such as }{\i\fs24 antipathy/sympathy }{\fs24 (antipathy effect), }{\i\fs24 
cause blindness/deafness, color spray }{\fs24 (most of the time), }{\i\fs24 contagion, }{\fs24 and }{\i\fs24 holy word }{\fs24 are examples of minor effects.
