\par }{\i\fs24 Extreme: }{\fs24 Includes effects that wrench the character\rquote s very being, such as }{\i\fs24 energy drains }{\fs24 (per level drained) and magical aging (per year aged). Two notable examples include the 9th\_level wizard spell }{\i\fs24 
energy drain }{\fs24 and the 6th\_level priest spell age creature from the }{\i\fs24 Tome of Magic}{\fs24 .
