\par }{\b\fs24\cf6 Extra Thieving Skills: }{\fs24 At 21st level, a bard gains two of the five new skills listed in the thief section. The skills have base scores as shown on Table 48, and the character can immediately apply discretionary points to the skills.

\par \tab If the character point system from }{\i\fs24 Player\rquote s Option: Skills & Powers }{\fs24 
